        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-darkbrown">8. Your Privacy Rights &amp; Data Deletion Instructions</h2>
        <div class="bg-brand-lightbeige border-l-4 border-brand-brown rounded-r-xl p-4 text-xs sm:text-sm">
